{"id":68347,"date":"2025-10-01T07:11:18","date_gmt":"2025-10-01T06:11:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68347"},"modified":"2026-09-28T20:25:58","modified_gmt":"2026-09-28T19:25:58","slug":"trail-este-romanico","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-este-romanico\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Este Romanico 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Este Romanico 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Este Rom\u00e2nico 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na ter\u00e7a-feira, <strong>1 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (feriado nacional), na freguesia de <strong>Arcos<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Vila do Conde<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. A prova \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural Movimento Vive Mais Arcos<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila do Conde<\/strong> e a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Arcos<\/strong>, promovendo a pr\u00e1tica desportiva em contacto estreito com a natureza e o patrim\u00f3nio este-rom\u00e2nico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento integra tr\u00eas percursos com partidas desfasadas: o <strong>Trail Curto (16 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h30, o <strong>Mini Trail (11 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h45 e a <strong>Caminhada (8 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 10h00. Os trajetos combinam estrad\u00f5es florestais, veredas rurais e passagens hist\u00f3ricas da regi\u00e3o, contando com postos de abastecimento, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip nas provas competitivas e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: bord